{
    "title": "Toy Blast",
    "description": "<b>Welcome to Toy Blast, the funniest puzzle game ever! </b>\r\n\r\nJump into the Toy world and help Amy through her adventurous journey. Blast the cubes and combine powerful boosters to beat the challenging levels. Join tournaments and events to compete with players all around the world!\r\n\r\nEverything you dreamed of is at your fingertips, with the most exciting puzzles you will ever see!\r\n\r\nOnce you play the colorful puzzles of Toy Blast, you will never look for anything else!\r\n\r\n<b>TOY BLAST FEATURES:</b>\r\n\r\n\u25cf Unique and exciting match-3 levels: fun boards featuring boosters and combos!\r\n\u25cf Hilarious episodes: discover all the adventures with Amy and her fantastic friends!\r\n\u25cf Fun events every day: Cube Party, Star Tournament, Team Adventure, Crown Rush, Rotor Party and Team Race!\r\n\u25cf Complete the daily challenges of Hoop Shot and win magnificent rewards!\r\n\u25cf Create your team and join the tournaments to get boosters and unlimited lives!\r\n\u25cf Compete with the best players in Legends Arena to get the grand prize!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Welcome to Toy Blast, the funniest puzzle game ever! </b><br><br>Jump into the Toy world and help Amy through her adventurous journey. Blast the cubes and combine powerful boosters to beat the challenging levels. Join tournaments and events to compete with players all around the world!<br><br>Everything you dreamed of is at your fingertips, with the most exciting puzzles you will ever see!<br><br>Once you play the colorful puzzles of Toy Blast, you will never look for anything else!<br><br><b>TOY BLAST FEATURES:</b><br><br>\u25cf Unique and exciting match-3 levels: fun boards featuring boosters and combos!<br>\u25cf Hilarious episodes: discover all the adventures with Amy and her fantastic friends!<br>\u25cf Fun events every day: Cube Party, Star Tournament, Team Adventure, Crown Rush, Rotor Party and Team Race!<br>\u25cf Complete the daily challenges of Hoop Shot and win magnificent rewards!<br>\u25cf Create your team and join the tournaments to get boosters and unlimited lives!<br>\u25cf Compete with the best players in Legends Arena to get the grand prize!",
